@startuml CU - Secuencia - Flujo General por Capas
' ===== Estetica SUNSET (identidad ExperienceHub) =====
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFDF9
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontColor #243B53
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 10
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #FF6B6B
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #FF8C42
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor #FFE8D6
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #243B53
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #FF6B6B
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontStyle bold
skinparam sequenceActorBorderColor #243B53
skinparam sequenceActorBackgroundColor #FFD166
skinparam sequenceActorFontColor #243B53
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #FF8C42
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #FF8C42
skinparam sequenceGroupHeaderFontColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor #FFFCF7
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3C4
skinparam noteBorderColor #FFD166
skinparam noteFontColor #243B53
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor #243B53
skinparam databaseBorderColor #243B53
skinparam databaseFontColor #FFFFFF
' =====================================================
title G - Flujo general de una operacion (patron por capas GUI -> BLL -> DAL)
actor "Usuario" as U
participant "Formulario\n(GUI : FormBase)" as GUI
participant "BLL.<Entidad>" as BLL
participant "PermisosAccion" as PA
participant "DAL.<Entidad>\n(: BaseDAL)" as DAL
participant "DAL.Acceso\n(Singleton)" as AC
participant "Servicios.Bitacora" as BIT
database "SQL Server" as DB

U -> GUI : dispara una accion (click)
GUI -> BLL : operacion de negocio(parametros)
BLL -> PA : Exigir(patenteEditar, patenteVer)
PA --> BLL : ok (fail-closed si no tiene permiso)
BLL -> BLL : validar reglas de negocio
BLL -> DAL : Insertar / Modificar / Obtener
DAL -> AC : Escribir / Leer (SQL parametrizado)
AC -> DB : comando ADO.NET
DB --> AC : filas / filas afectadas
AC --> DAL : resultado
DAL -> DAL : recalcular DVH de la fila (T07)
DAL --> BLL : entidad / id
BLL -> BIT : Registrar(modulo, actividad, criticidad)
BLL --> GUI : resultado
GUI --> U : mensaje / grilla actualizada

note over GUI,DAL
  La GUI nunca accede a DAL ni a Seguridad: solo invoca BLL.
  Toda validacion vive en BLL; DAL usa siempre el Singleton Acceso.
end note
@enduml
